 # Status
 
-Last updated: 2026-05-05
+Last updated: 2026-08-29
+
+## 2026-08-29 Torii MCP wallet submission and instruction filters
+
+- `iroha.transactions.submit_and_wait` now decodes and verifies Torii's signed
+  Norito submission receipt, rejects caller-supplied hash mismatches, polls the
+  verified receipt hash through authoritative global state finality, and
+  returns a coherent JSON receipt projection with the raw transaction hash
+  used by MCP status responses. Norito HTTP bodies are always represented as
+  base64 in MCP results, even when their bytes also happen to be valid UTF-8.
+- Explorer instruction queries now accept an explicit `asset_definition_id`
+  filter. Combined account/definition filtering matches the same transfer or
+  batch leg, so incoming and outgoing wallet history are both included without
+  cross-entry false positives.
+- Curated MCP schemas now advertise the routed `asset`/`scope` account-assets
+  keys, transaction-status `scope`, and the strict instruction-definition
+  filter instead of relying on permissive undeclared properties.
+- Validation:
+  - `cargo fmt --all -- --check`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii normalize_verified_transaction_submission --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii canonical_submit_wait_status_poll_forces_global_scope --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii authoritative_global_applied_status_requires_state_and_positive_block --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii pipeline_status_handler_global_scope_ignores_terminal_cache_and_reads_state --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii instruction_list_schema_and_dispatch_advertise_asset_definition_filter --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii account_assets_and_transaction_status_schemas_advertise_routed_query_keys --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii explorer_instruction_definition_filter --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii extract_transaction_hash_from_submit_result_decodes_submission_receipt --lib -- --nocapture`
+  - `cargo test -p iroha_torii decode_response_body_always_base64_encodes_norito_even_when_utf8 --lib -- --nocapture`
 
